# Feature Work Index

This directory stores durable feature/task records created from `.agent/task-board.json`.

Use it for work that needs cross-session continuity, delegated handoff, review evidence, or delivery history. Tiny low-risk changes may only need a session note, but bugfix, standard, and full workflow profiles should create a task-board record.

## Task Board

```bash
python3 scripts/agent_task.py list
python3 scripts/agent_task.py new <task-id> --title "<title>" --profile standard --risk medium
python3 scripts/agent_task.py update <task-id> --state review --stage verification
python3 scripts/agent_task.py doctor
```

## Stage Documents

Profiles choose how many stage documents are required:

- `tiny`: no feature document required by default.
- `bugfix`: requirement, development, test report, delivery summary.
- `standard`: requirement, design, development, code review, test report, delivery summary.
- `full`: requirement, design, gate review, development, code review, test report, delivery summary.

Generated feature directories should be named `docs/features/<task-id>/`.
